  "body": "Located in super central Takapuna's Byron Avenue. The receiver has clear instructions to sell, and expectations have been reset to meet the market. For first home buyers and investors, this is a rare chance to secure a spacious, modern Takapuna home on realistic terms.\r\n\r\nUnit 6 is near new three bedroom terrace home with flexi living options. 179 sq m of easy-care living. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area has a full suite of Bosch appliances and flows to a northerly spacious deck. Three bedrooms, three bathrooms, study,  and tandem garaging for two cars complete the picture, and full Code Compliance and freehold title add peace of mind. No body corporate fee! \r\n\r\nTakapuna Beach, cafés, restaurants and shopping are all within walking distance, and the motorway makes for an easy commute to the CBD. The home is also zoned for some of the North Shore’s most sought-after schools: Takapuna Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar and Westlake Girls.\r\n\r\nWhether it’s your first step onto the property ladder or a quality, low-maintenance investment, it’s a smart buy in one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal suburbs. \r\n\r\nAUCTION: 2.30 p.m. Thursday 3rd December 2026 In rooms, 159 Hurstmere Road, Takapuna (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nCall Alison Parker on 021983533 or Devon Francis on 0224686934 at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty today to view.",
